# WiW Midnight Server Notes

Private WoW server project based on TrinityCore (master), built to match the BalticCore repack.

## Versions
- Game build: 12.1.0 (69587)
- Database: TDB 1210.26091
- Repack SQL fix: 17/09/2026

## Not in this repo (never upload these)
- The game client
- worldserver.conf and bnetserver.conf (they hold passwords and IPs). Copy the .conf.dist files and edit your own copies locally.
- Compiled files and build folders

## Building
Needs Visual Studio 2022 (C++ workload), CMake, Boost, OpenSSL and MySQL. Follow the TrinityCore install guide for Windows.

## Workflow
- Don't push straight to main.
- Make your own branch, commit your changes, and open a pull request.
- Test against a server running build 69587.

